  Slug: adept-benefit-tome
  DisplayName: Adept Benefit (Tome)
  IconPath: icons/sundries/books/book-symbol-yellow-grey.webp
  Description: 'In addition to the initiate benefits, your tome inscribes insights
    into creatures that you can use to strike them down. While holding your tome,
    at the start of your turn each round, attempt a check to Recall Knowledge about
    a creature of your choice that you''re observing. If this check succeeds, you
    gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your next attack roll against that creature before
    the start of your next turn. @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect:
    Tome Adept Benefit] When you gain temporary skill proficiencies during your daily
    preparations, one is at expert proficiency and the other at master proficiency.
    At 9th level, you have master proficiency in both.'
